# Recollections (windurst 67), completion parity: 275's finish with the sabots given is the Lua's raw
# player:completeQuest (after the var, the key item and the fame), so a GM's Quest[2][67]Prog survives the completion
# (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). The Three Magi completed and this quest
# accepted with Foe Finder MK I (GM), beside Chumimi.
char zone=HeavensTower pos=0.0,30.75,21.5 job=BLM lvl=75
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi completed
quest Windurst.Recollections accepted
keyitem FoeFinderMkI
login
charvar Quest[2][67]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Chumimi                         # accepted, Foe Finder MK I: 275
finish                                  # the Wizard's Sabots; var 0; the key item taken; fame 20; completed; Prog kept
